# Vendored avatar art (SVG Repo). These are third-party assets, not source we
# maintain, so they are exempt from the whitespace checks the release suite
# runs via `git diff --check`. Without this, 29 files of trailing whitespace
# drown out any real finding, and the alternative — reformatting them — edits
# artwork we did not author for no benefit.
server/web/avatars/**/*.svg -whitespace
